{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1018418-merit-costs","id":1018418,"title":"Merit Costs","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-12-17T04:26:08-08:00","id":1018418,"title":"Merit Costs","content":"Here's a question I have about spending Experience on Merits (and by extension, Skills). This is probably answered somewhere else in the forums or by Onyx Path, but I can't find where.<br /> <br /> So the revised rules state that Merits cost &quot;1 Experience per dot.&quot; I can't figure out if this means per the dot itself or per level of dot. So let's say you already have one dot in a stackable Merit, such as Language or Professional Training, and you want to buy a second dot. Will it cost 1 Experience, since you're buying a single dot, or 2 Experience, since you're buying the second level dot?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/2.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12708-chesh","name":"Chesh","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12708_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"238"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-17T04:38:43-08:00","id":1018421,"title":"","content":"It means &quot;per individual dot&quot;. All the costs are flat in 2e.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avata